Namespace Goedel.Protocol ProtocolConstants
	|Constants specified in hallambaker-mesh-udf


File SequenceEvents
	Enum SequenceEvent "Sequence Events"

		Code Initial				"Initial"
			Description
				|Default initial state of entry in a sequence
		Code Read					"Read"
			Description
				|Entry has been read but the contents have not been changed.
		Code Update					"Update"
			Description
				|Entry has been updated.
		Code Delete					"Delete"
			Description
				|Entry has been deleted but the value can still be recovered from the sequence.
		Code Erase					"Erase"
			Description
				|Entry has been deleted and the value erased.
		Code Updates					"Updates"
			Description
				|Entry contains an updates set
		Code Index					"Index"
			Description
				|Entry contains an index
		Code Witness				"Witness"
			Description
				|Entry contains witness values from other logs.
